    "title": "South Korea gears up for Trump visit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CNN ,\n31 minutes ago APEC’s return to South Korea after 20 years, coupled with US President Donald Trump’s visit has sparked speculation about a potential revival of Trump-Kim diplomacy. CNN’s Will Ripley asks South Korean President Lee Jae Myung about his expectations for next week’s leaders’ summit. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
